  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f5820acf3be10cc6909814b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到公告了。\r\n快点去确认吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8bd15ee0df46658dc2810576a8dea586fb2dfb8c2dd942198879f72ee4dbc3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41637254281b244dbd8f7008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然会有送给小狗的礼物啊。\r\n看来你有乖乖在当好孩子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a57a1db2dfd81820fc50b3dca17e838236653e1d0849645ad887c120bed1fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3fc029f3046f0327d03a42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务好像达成了啊。\r\n下次也务必妥善完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb66e3551edbbffa4983bd3d21cadf75a8f7dd4a4a88c4236e478cf99fdf6768",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc4c07d146d70436aa12b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎在举办活动。\r\n……只要那家伙不要多管闲事，\r\n我怎样都无所谓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db582285ec35f59eab0d892120f23bc03ba19ac8ea703c1a31bd22408b67d7a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28d0b8057b47d777b14ad2fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办。\r\n参不参加随便你。\r\n我可没兴趣整天牵着你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e581e0ed2cbfc1e55d4a84e20490ef9cd0067647bbf23b5b0b31969b214e99db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31357208958773ddee94cff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别屈服，还有下次机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b52980946268af9115ff13b206de7d41b4de74d2682d68edfb24bb09472c7f38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:083ee91eb9254df7edbc7a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级似乎提升了。\r\n记得去确认一遍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c6a000a5ffa108c17a8318471139e768e24bc778195aad5e3f3dd11bad65167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eea59e8b7afe8a813f4dcb07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仕立て先は決めたところがある。\r\n腕がいい。文句つけんなら、税関で\r\n郵送に時間がかかることくらいだな",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd98e435a63522773046489332936a31085989f95eabe595b9de5cbee6d0284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dab057fb907ad5ad28f093b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生地もアクセサリーも、\r\n他人が選択したモンはどうも\r\n着心地が悪い。",
      "source_fingerprint": "830634a065970fd4d205e07923f53052a22ff0ba4e055b484368f7e85f6c9a2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c58da347e51c54264f30d3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この靴は、脚ぶん回すのにも\r\nちょうどよくてな…。\r\nハハッ、試してやろうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b94db0ca6c1e49839af0eddd3ea6fe58e11990d2e450a5c0f48a92d78e72c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b851c6a4f889defa0747eff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，还差一步啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "706d8b6a30ec5ea20d47a6c1aedcb77b3b2a3a2ec20536c4994390c5817d6123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1496e2fdb4ef97cfd860e8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8268e3074e5a16b79ba4787a8cde185924899d24b88fe9970b7dd1b20cd4d9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651acefcea50142a41852038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别屈服，还有下次机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b52980946268af9115ff13b206de7d41b4de74d2682d68edfb24bb09472c7f38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28664b16831a824974b9678e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，还差一步啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "706d8b6a30ec5ea20d47a6c1aedcb77b3b2a3a2ec20536c4994390c5817d6123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ca9db049f7c6336d6e6aa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，高分纪录更新了啊。还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9051f368ae61067bcd853807cb64f220e650ac8488685a033d4b19d8ba6549b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5935e021f537bfae67910775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可别让我看到丢脸的竞赛啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e919942fe2f7a823352c96423581407e82eee9ad9964e4dfd5bc381aa3336701",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1242026f146e05e0d8dc4569",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7321e7fe6afff257ac8dd4d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练内容安排好了。\r\n在开始前你记得先看过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f47c3e665175818be31c80f7896f64fbbf97c92fb9d23d5739b093d470e8ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42dc126d0991f22f72cc6d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历史啊……\r\n总有一天，我会全部改写。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6c446d7cab1fa08a78731d5f3e23ff560e7c430213bcfcb0e22add0aa25a2a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67522a385f036b1395e9aea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名参赛吗？\r\n随便你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f70fb6c9a8f1ce15d4da9289048393d05e2f1000d4fcd3ec006f719f285046c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:419215f4d3c211f0896aa877",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会赢的那种！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15cf7e00c0c17d6155e0ba0ee5b813ea96ccfc4aa0e2ee2fefb5bb2790f3fa12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb65c5b240eb28814cfc8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可没打算和你交好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d8226f7ddaf032701c2ec0d9af565f0a0ede134eda099dcb8a26e4e476ec43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:876ea3bb55ce2b9f97165b26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着我来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "009c012ff1eecefa2c150f09f3c37a8305042c8e468ea163cf87b6e339ffc653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b462f7bc3659dc06912a66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba54e14db39e86f4e1f962a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哈哈！\r\n虽然很不可思议，但还不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b9efdca6e700559c755dbe7f62dfde24fb93f19100bcb9a784625a877d71e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb543838bd70675fe985d7f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73721b8335a94da3c762b7d5e9ab6520e07fc186168e42c5a639ff8176a57c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b3062c0547160f0a819b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我看看你的本事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84527f030b5142be6dc0cbc8eb95e9316d4c7dd9bfa5368e67b7c35e8c7c5200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
