      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态低迷。\r\n……原因会是什么。\r\n让我听听你的看法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ac867ab6aba6aa43285f078570239eee8a034bd9f4a11e91db9361c80766f02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09106008e2504887aaf9c3a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，状态近乎完美。\r\n喂，快点开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "845950d687b8e64cef73c2830f7b1c245b0139c86d7315e536ece83a3445edcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e533eb074a6e192ae53182e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的道路由我自己开拓。\r\n无论如何，\r\n我总有一天会抵达巅峰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a028bc3d7aab1162255b95db9894e30ecc8596acdc076ed7a190ecfc9d390ac2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4310f859822a996605f821cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天狼星是最明亮的星星，\r\n这件事你要时刻牢记在心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4994235c194050ec5b1b022c38dcfc99a07113c9bb0c529f46edaec53392b864",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56ae5115d10564cf71ccb1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态比预期得更好。\r\n我要增加训练项目，\r\n你也快去准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce45f7d33e8fcdf637e836c0727974c837ab02b9ddba2794bdc39e8a2a2cd4d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b0e88503d5c2d65af252b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要我进行你制定的\r\n训练项目就赢过我。\r\n规则本来就是这样，不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "424958238182d37691c03896761c54d8ac10a3ccaff9b6e5555efcf3520571cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a873bc5be33b295e9f33e136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是看似一成不变的日常，\r\n时间依旧每分每秒在流逝。\r\n仔细审视一切，省去无谓之事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a21e958bb13a0523767f08f45b89fdb5afc58dc48c822992cf6eb00da37e8113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb42750b0df496ad707282ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真麻烦。\r\n这点程度虽然是还能跑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7afc75ffb6654ff4f830bb985c6ebc56480822ee604ae72a1b407b9cd042d522",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83bf93c4927e8f2149cfe26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，该死的！\r\n今天那家伙一派轻松的表情\r\n动不动就在我脑中闪过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed7143741c8738309fd31e1cd1393d039e216958d13bbfa36aa0a7a5ef36917f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463fd433794f157ec14fd02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哈啊……啧。\r\n别用那种眼神看着我，我还能跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6701f9d65d72200f0bd026e86aca9474f10a08a5fe95433f99d05cccd2c3d928",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20e39f574454d9014a4de5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我想喝香料味十足的汤。\r\n……待会去做给我喝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88fc8489a0a743187c048ec117b16c172282139e1c5de2feb27a5679d256969a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b1ce49b80a8ae97ab97f46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果一直埋首参加竞赛就能\r\n抵达巅峰的话，我愿意奉陪……\r\n但实际上呢？啊？你解释看看啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a910dfa0924fff059e17a66bfe56d4f4788cc7e1fa33116eaf3e839ceb5a1a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1372eca7810a9486cdf26180",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被职权耍着玩可是让我厌恶到作呕。\r\n如果你是在明白这点的前提下这么做\r\n……就代表你应该做好觉悟了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0fc1b8bb3ad9e7dc0b7fd847af5b8778307b06c04a1431f5fc026046a71902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab4e6022af8e2505844b70e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈！力量充沛到想笑出来，\r\n双脚非常轻盈！\r\n啊啊，这就是所谓的状态绝佳吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8816c6c635d196c811cee3fa4bfd051461c456900dfa3deb8db23553f57447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e0eedc3c23d608206a6a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乖乖抱着期待坐着就好，小狗。\r\n我会带着荣耀之冠回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf0cc926eecdfb23f817987e6deca0ec0f46cee2d6682a724914e475a314b892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77de5cba26485c7fdcc5928f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人让开，\r\n今天的胜利是属于我的。\r\n谁也别想碰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "718c561f626f020519eba1a82ba42ee1486286401850e5bb0610ce9493c25a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3479f95bb601088aecaae3d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让观众席知道\r\n一等星有多么明亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "130485cd0791bd6834f2ce00fe47a9d86cfc9d995270362b2c71cd2a40d09627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6045162432c8c10e569a8da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态还不错。\r\n……哼，我会展示我的獠牙，\r\n给我睁大眼睛看好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df42955cd9d32368a589348b38afe5b5893559f6b3c7b1fd8bcc232fc4b84b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fddb0c0bed9b242d2c0bca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的选择没有错。\r\n既然如此，今天也只有\r\n胜利在前方等着我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e990b2f479bed6811532a1c6ec5d2e4ff61a3a0f19099e3793446a2b4be6509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6ae2eef473298e387f25f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态还不错。\r\n就像以往一样，\r\n开拓道路吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecfabd7ffff701eae52f8c8f55a42a25012a83df241264731532f55210c66af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b59fea03f8bbe0eef91d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做的事情没有改变。\r\n唯有不断奔驰……直到胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4fcc0737d478378d599e567d241ae771981ce840b56f429b8d9487df3e48fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7376d75aab3525ed49c773e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多要开始了吧……\r\n看我席卷整座赛道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa7f9aab3324d731af0dcb22d4c7c3c80676fcf56b6f02c582fc4d38af2875c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5012e7bb8ceb7043b8e6c9bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哼，\r\n跟状态好不好无关，\r\n今天的竞赛只有一次……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dac39e4305ae89aaff55ae105ff52d74947ae5f80ad3bbbbbe055ca82413103e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:066c9360a030b3d2c64ae5e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唉！竟然输给了\r\n我眼中的输家。\r\n这就是竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d24de1670b697a5ac6e6a5a29efdfdf37f4f11d304da0710c5b755d7727269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac64b265d5e5a6d05d50053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，爱操心的个性跑出来啰，小狗。\r\n闭上嘴看着吧，\r\n我会让你忘记我状态不佳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60971593dd345bd6e29b83808a6999f9e200b4b658af1dc2ca7bf5cbcb81d89d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d86b8dcb9ab90fb64f9db8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……明显是调整不完备啊，\r\n但……反省之后再说。\r\n我可不会做出放弃比赛这种事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfa5830e434997c225562f74dd3b4f69bb5a2125d5f66f1cd4c7cbaabd2442a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2897fd031c399eafba4e23a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啧。啊啊，可恶，\r\n注意力完全没办法集中啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "486e67ea8985736c9698b2f3fb2a9ef5ef5d813a6ea1df96220d893c86dd633e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6224d752f3924b24a4c270e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我该抵达的目标是颠峰……\r\n可不能让你看见丢脸的模样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd32b5429f5d1e33f126e7a4b117206bbbd0252acd6c69362f76918976e7c9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a705584d0fd8696e915c31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:785c85abb33eaefff026eb91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "906942bbb604a244eb819071224dda2b492e8920fb3df0257cb4f93537c6ba8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1549a7835fd1c02bf7c6d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a25799dd76bfa520a5f4c036ab04cdf7b7efa393e6aec83197ef3c295c8c44c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82611d197a78f860215827c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很简单。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb54d39c27a711e54de269f5c7781fa4bc1f7de37ba53cfc748b83975545d4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:262b4c89f042876675dc96ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56c21aca34e886ec318bf0c042d3b04361a8565a18a4568d1f9cb3234644f17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20042"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
